{"id":"nemalo","lemma":"немало","pos":"adv","rank":2229,"glosses":["quite a bit, a great deal","considerably"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Осталось ещё немало воды.","en":"There is quite a bit of water remaining.","words":[{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},{"g":"still / more"},null,{"g":"water","l":"вода"}]},{"text":"Немало людей говорили мне не есть там.","en":"A bunch of people told me not to eat there.","words":[null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Этот человек немало помог моей семье.","en":"That man's helped my family a lot.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"person"},null,{"g":"to help","l":"помочь"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Кажется, у нас немало проблем.","en":"It seems we have quite a few problems.","words":[{"g":"apparently, it seems"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},null,null]},{"text":"Прошло немало времени.","en":"It's been a while.","words":[{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"}]}]}